<view class="settings-page">
  <cu-custom bgColor="bg-gradual-blue" isBack="{{true}}">
    <view slot="backText">返回</view>
    <view slot="content">演示与 AI 说明</view>
  </cu-custom>

  <view class="main-container">
    <view class="settings-section">
      <view class="section-title"><text class="cuIcon-people text-blue"></text><text>演示登录</text></view>
      <view class="settings-card">
        <view class="setting-item">
          <view class="item-info">
            <text class="item-title">当前状态：{{demoMode ? '已开启' : '已关闭'}}</text>
            <text class="item-desc">演示模式跳过 wx.login，测试号无需配置真实微信登录。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-item" wx:if="{{demoMode}}">
          <view class="item-info">
            <text class="item-title">固定演示 openid</text>
            <text class="item-desc">{{demoOpenid}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="settings-section">
      <view class="section-title"><text class="cuIcon-scan text-green"></text><text>AI 连接</text></view>
      <view class="settings-card">
        <view class="setting-item">
          <view class="item-info">
            <text class="item-title">识别与六维分析</text>
            <text class="item-desc">未配置 AI 密钥时，识别与评分由本地规则兜底，流程照常走通。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="setting-item">
          <view class="item-info">
            <text class="item-title">它的下一站</text>
            <text class="item-desc">卖掉、送人、回收、扔掉都有对应文案，未连 AI 时由规则生成。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="settings-section">
      <view class="section-title"><text class="cuIcon-info text-orange"></text><text>决策原则</text></view>
      <view class="settings-card">
        <view class="setting-item">
          <view class="item-info">
            <text class="item-title">最终决定权在你</text>
            <text class="item-desc">AI 只提供评分、理由和下一步，留下还是送走，你说了算。</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
